# <type>(<scope>): <short summary, imperative, <=72 chars>
#
# Allowed <type>:
#   feat     — new user-facing feature            -> minor bump
#   fix      — bug fix                            -> patch bump
#   perf     — performance improvement            -> patch bump
#   refactor — code change without feature/fix    -> no bump
#   docs     — documentation only                 -> no bump
#   test     — tests only                         -> no bump
#   build    — build system / dependencies        -> no bump
#   ci       — CI / release config                -> no bump
#   chore    — housekeeping                       -> no bump
#   revert   — revert of a previous commit        -> see footer
#
# <scope> is optional: api, db, auth, release, deps, ...
#
# ---- body (optional, wrap at 72) ----
# Why the change is needed, what alternative was discarded,
# links to issues (Refs: #123).
#
# ---- footer (optional) ----
# BREAKING CHANGE: describe the incompatible change    -> major bump
# Refs: #123
# Co-authored-by: Name <email>
